10
00:00:24,868 --> 00:00:26,936
And for that, you can use a free service

11
00:00:27,049 --> 00:00:29,342
called Tailscale. You can also pay for it,

12
00:00:29,694 --> 00:00:31,715
and this is not sponsored or anything like

13
00:00:31,763 --> 00:00:34,457
