00:00:41,159 --> 00:00:43,292
plan, which is free. And what this allows

18
00:00:43,324 --> 00:00:44,334
you to do is

19
00:00:44,863 --> 00:00:48,182
it allows you to add devices to a so-called

20
00:00:48,279 --> 00:00:50,491
tailnet, which is in the end a VPN

21
00:00:51,325 --> 00:00:54,372
network, so to say. So it's a network of

22
00:00:54,372 --> 00:00:56,697
devices that are connected to each other

23
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,409
through the public internet, but in an

24
00:00:59,441 --> 00:01:02,137
encrypted, secure way, essentially

25
00:01:02,185 --> 00:01:05,700
establishing a private network over the

26
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:08,540
public internet, so to say. So your own

27
00:01:08,588 --> 00:01:10,915
secure space in the public internet, you

28
00:01:10,915 --> 00:01:11,300
could say.

29
00:01:12,295 --> 00:01:13,691
So you can log in,

30
00:01:14,269 --> 00:01:17,237
