31
00:01:17,478 --> 00:01:20,222
on your VPS, you now need to install the

32
00:01:20,302 --> 00:01:23,672
Tailscale tool, the Tailscale software, so

33
00:01:23,672 --> 00:01:24,025
to say,

34
00:01:24,779 --> 00:01:27,474
to be able to connect this VPS to your

35
00:01:28,243 --> 00:01:30,567
network, to your Tailscale network. At the

36
00:01:30,567 --> 00:01:33,243
same time, you wanna go to the Tailscale

37
00:01:33,371 --> 00:01:36,175
download page, tailscale.com/download,

38
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:39,091
and install the Tailscale client for your

39
00:01:39,139 --> 00:01:41,254
device, which can also be a mobile phone,

40
00:01:41,767 --> 00:01:44,475
Android, iOS, all supported. So you can even

41
00:01:44,571 --> 00:01:46,718
