too later in the course. But for now, I'll

44
00:01:51,236 --> 00:01:53,848
just download the client for my system, in

45
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:54,793
my case macOS.

46
00:01:55,322 --> 00:01:58,160
And after downloading it, you can install

47
00:01:58,289 --> 00:02:01,303
it. And once you installed it, you'll have

48
00:02:01,335 --> 00:02:01,928
to log in

49
00:02:02,522 --> 00:02:04,670
in the Tailscale software. And once you did

50
00:02:04,783 --> 00:02:06,322
that, you can go back to your

51
00:02:06,867 --> 00:02:09,673
VPS and also install Tailscale there. You'll

52
00:02:09,673 --> 00:02:11,662
essentially need to install it on all the

53
00:02:11,662 --> 00:02:13,409
devices that should be part of your own

54
00:02:13,506 --> 00:02:16,376
private network. And on the VPS, you install

55
00:02:16,552 --> 00:02:18,540
Tailscale according to their Install

56
00:02:18,717 --> 00:02:20,817
Tailscale on Linux instructions, and you'll

57
00:02:20,817 --> 00:02:22,854
find a link to this article attached. It's

58
00:02:23,126 --> 00:02:25,242
this command which you wanna copy and you

59
00:02:25,371 --> 00:02:27,198
run this on your VPS.

60
00:02:27,775 --> 00:02:29,089
I need to enter my password here

61
00:02:30,276 --> 00:02:32,392
and this will now download Tailscale onto

62
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:32,969
that VPS

63
00:02:33,626 --> 00:02:35,357
and then make it available there.

64
00:02:36,047 --> 00:02:37,698
And once it was installed, you need to run

65
00:02:37,746 --> 00:02:41,353
sudo tailscale up to start the Tailscale

66
00:02:41,417 --> 00:02:43,453
service there just as we started it on our

67
00:02:43,965 --> 00:02:45,953
device, on our Mac, on our Windows device.

68
00:02:46,626 --> 00:02:46,723
Now

69
00:02:47,252 --> 00:02:49,672
once you start it, just as I had to

70
00:02:49,672 --> 00:02:51,436
authenticate on my Mac, I need to

71
00:02:51,452 --> 00:02:52,349
authenticate there too.

72
00:02:52,958 --> 00:02:55,459
But of course I have no browser So I'll just

73
00:02:55,523 --> 00:02:58,214
copy that link and open it on my Mac here.

74
00:02:58,823 --> 00:03:00,634
So I'm not on the VPS, this is my normal

