184
00:07:23,108 --> 00:07:25,742
And therefore, of course, that means nobody

185
00:07:25,775 --> 00:07:26,112
but you,

186
00:07:26,722 --> 00:07:30,401
only your Tailscale devices, the devices

187
00:07:30,417 --> 00:07:32,281
that are part of your Tailscale network,

188
00:07:32,747 --> 00:07:35,623
Only these devices can connect to that VPS.

189
00:07:35,976 --> 00:07:38,853
And that's of course much more secure than

190
00:07:38,853 --> 00:07:39,543
